After re-deriving the same settled strategy 3x (should-we-switch / why-leaders-win / what-rapid-lever),
add a strategic-decisions table to the levers ledger so the answers live in the record, not in a fresh
re-derivation. Captures: (1) the embrace-a-generator + extend-with-energy "switch" is the STANDING
north-star hybrid (north-star.md §0, 2026-06-08: generator=commodity, energy=verification layer) and
its blocker is recorded -- the ARC energy verifier is at CHANCE cross-game (LOO AUROC 0.503,
frame-marginal features, arc_discriminative_verifier.json); (2) leaders win by NOT doing weak-model
symbolic induction; the wall is GENERATION not selection; (3) rapid-lever space is swept (the 44-lever
inventory); (4) winning ARC != proving the verifier thesis (generation-bound venue mismatch). The ONE
open strategic item is a BUILD not a decision: the oracle-distinct structural-energy moat (GAP-ARCH-
FEATURES, DiffusionGemma gate STILL-PENDING) -- a multi-week build, not a deadline-week lever.
Cross-linked to north-star.md §0/§5, arc-energy-augmented-strategy.md, the evidence.

